  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0160_rival_01",
      "hash": "b7318e41cd49272e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「啊！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳來得正好！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0160_rival_02",
      "hash": "b7318d41cd49257b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！這座城市裡\\n有[VAR COLOR(0006)]寶可夢道館[VAR COLOR(0000)]。\\c\\n訓練家可以在那裡\\n跟實力強大的[VAR COLOR(0006)]道館館主[VAR COLOR(0000)]對戰！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0160_rival_05",
      "hash": "b7319241cd492dfa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "雖說道館館主不好對付，\\n但如果想要變強的話，\\r\\n可不能放過挑戰的機會喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0160_rival_04",
      "hash": "b7319341cd492fad",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「哦～！\\n[VAR PKNICK(0003)]也想去挑戰是吧！\\r\\n我就知道！\\c\\n好！我會為你們加油的。\\n這是我的一點心意！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0160_sys_01",
      "hash": "ca5507f550d8c8dd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從[VAR TRNAME(0001)]那裡\\n得到了５個傷藥！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0160_rival_03",
      "hash": "b7318c41cd4923c8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我用到現在為止存下的獎金\\n把[VAR TRNAME(0000)][VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的份也買了！\\c\\n要是能打贏道館館主，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳就是個夠格的訓練家了！\\r\\n加油吧！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0160_max",
